Chapter: BvtLightShape
  cites Uoaix chapter SkillsItemsPackets
  cites Uoaix chapter GamePackets
  cites Uoaix chapter WorldRecords
  cites Uoaix chapter WorldDecoration
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 A light-source item's 0x1A carries its light shape in the direction byte (x bit 0x8000, the byte before z); an absent
 byte draws ServUO's ArchedWindowEast, the window light Damian saw on the campfire and the Royal Mine gate (2026-10-13).
  blsh-item : Integer -> WorldObject
  blsh-item (art) = WorldObject { serial = #40000123, kind = 2, x = 1418, y = 1700, z = 5, graphic = art, hue = 0, container = 0, amount = 1, health = 0 }
  blsh-shape : List Integer -> Integer
  blsh-shape (p) = if list-length p /= 15 | bit-and (gp-u16 p 9) #8000 == 0 then 0 - 1 else list-at p 13
  bvt-light-shape : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-light-shape (unused) = act
    a <- bvt-check "a burning campfire, the blue moongate and the Royal Mine's red gate draw Circle300 (29), a smouldering fire Circle150 (2), z after the shape" (blsh-shape (sip-ground (blsh-item #0DE3)) == 29 & blsh-shape (sip-ground (blsh-item #0F6C)) == 29 & blsh-shape (sip-ground (blsh-item #0DDA)) == 29 & blsh-shape (sip-ground (blsh-item #0DE9)) == 2 & list-at (sip-ground (blsh-item #0DE3)) 14 == 5)
    b <- bvt-check "a plain item sends no shape byte and keeps x and its 14-byte layout" (list-length (sip-ground (blsh-item #0EED)) == 14 & gp-u16 (sip-ground (blsh-item #0EED)) 9 == 1418 & list-at (sip-ground (blsh-item #0EED)) 13 == 5)
    c <- bvt-check "a decoration lamp post draws Circle300 (29), a candle Circle150 (2), another light keeps its imported shape, an unlit art none" (wd-light-shape #0B21 1 == 29 & wd-light-shape #0B1A 1 == 2 & wd-light-shape #1854 1 == 2 & wd-light-shape #0A22 1 == 1 & wd-light-shape #0B21 (0 - 1) == 0 - 1)
    a + b + c
  end
